 near-peer mentorship with RMSD Student Fellows\, and a reflection tool\; c
 ompleting all components earns a SOAR Completion Letter that can be listed
  on a CV/residency application.\nHost: SOAR Office\, Baylor College of Med
 icine\nDetails: https://jerrywang123454321-maker.github.io/bcm-events/even
 t/255.html
